        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뜨겁게 타오르는 불꽃의 혀로\n아이앤트의 강철 몸을\n녹여서 알맹이를 먹어치운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec sa langue de feu à haute température, il fait\nfondre le corps d’acier des Fermite pour les dévorer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seiner brandheißen Zunge bringt es Fermicula\nzum Schmelzen, um so an sein weiches Inneres\nzu gelangen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa su lengua de fuego para derretir la armadura de\nacero de los Durant y llegar así hasta su interior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con la sua lingua infuocata scioglie la corazza\nd’acciaio di Durant e ne consuma l’interno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues,\nthey burn through Durant’s steel bodies and\nconsume their insides.",
